<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank sees Italy in first EMU wave.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank sees Italy in first EMU wave.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian central bank director Adolf Wala said on Tuesday he expected Italy to be part of the first wave of nations to join Europe's planned single currency in January 1999.</p>
<p>&quot;My prognosis is that Italy will be part of monetary union in the first stage,&quot; he told reporters during a banking conference. &quot;If Italy fulfils the criteria we would not hesitate to accept the accession of Italy.&quot; -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
